{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":3085,\"title\":\"Lloyd in Space\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd in Space is an animated television series, created by Joe Ansolabehere and Paul Germain, and released in 2001 on ABC-TV on Saturday mornings. The pilot was written by Ansolabehere, Germain and Mark Drop. The characters were designed by Eric Keyes.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ysifCfQ5yrjsopi4d8kgycmYr3Y.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hNt0OEzqkWBhvjLcFa0UYDbrYQU.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":20,\"year\":2001,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Kids\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":4,\"totalEpisodes\":39,\"createdBy\":[\"Paul Germain\",\"Joe Ansolabehere\"],\"networks\":[\"Disney Channel\",\"ABC\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2004-02-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":80699,\"name\":\"Howy Parkins\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gsdko6FykrdxPOW3GwgJgWjvHiV.jpg\"},{\"id\":55961,\"name\":\"Courtland Mead\",\"character\":\"Lloyd Nebulon (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/71Npi8B3YfSbOOXo5uvT5Nhn3Ah.jpg\"},{\"id\":1174402,\"name\":\"Nicolette Little\",\"character\":\"Francine Nebulon (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":60741,\"name\":\"April Winchell\",\"character\":\"Nora Nebulon (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/twx3xkmvRAuHHJp3xUd1sbxTZRS.jpg\"},{\"id\":1535,\"name\":\"Brian Doyle-Murray\",\"character\":\"Leo Andromedos (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3RFH00449ppcwA0tkD1uqDvP865.jpg\"},{\"id\":58511,\"name\":\"Brian George\",\"character\":\"Station (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mHjc58pfKkxtghhliPOnNz0SlcT.jpg\"},{\"id\":167638,\"name\":\"Justin Shenkarow\",\"character\":\"Edward \\\"Eddie\\\" Horton (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uxy54aFyWM1Bow5P9EAY4iCyMbu.jpg\"},{\"id\":6009,\"name\":\"Pamela Hayden\",\"character\":\"Douglas McNoggin (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPMtuVB6AEulRhlfn69y5RvgmNT.jpg\"},{\"id\":34398,\"name\":\"Bill Fagerbakke\",\"character\":\"Kurt Blobberts (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zntKKc1uT53BnIihmzbq601eWKZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":5727,\"name\":\"Diedrich Bader\",\"character\":\"Boomer (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z7CctykPTuXDfAs7pkAA7vW4b3T.jpg\"},{\"id\":15762,\"name\":\"Tara Strong\",\"character\":\"Good Cindy (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Cm3X7CCSuYbjW1ZKJ8vxCj4SI7.jpg\"},{\"id\":167640,\"name\":\"Mayim Bialik\",\"character\":\"Bad Cindy (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kPsafWVc5H565iTuwS85LtDvvsf.jpg\"},{\"id\":35224,\"name\":\"Anndi McAfee\",\"character\":\"Brittany Boviak (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/31BmotCrcdSR6gFnJqqCUHvy6Dh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1225518,\"name\":\"Rachel Crane\",\"character\":\"Megan Uno (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gyXrEFddpX2lETvIoeJYq1mNB2Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":34983,\"name\":\"Tress MacNeille\",\"character\":\"Barbara Bolt (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6JNNnG2hbGVtkf6AtVXEhrV1wsr.jpg\"},{\"id\":198,\"name\":\"Dan Castellaneta\",\"character\":\"Dunkirque (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AmeqWhP4A46AWkM4kVphg6jOTQX.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"bLfgDe3u47A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JCaEk-2RKsk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"A5C9TqGYpio\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ysifCfQ5yrjsopi4d8kgycmYr3Y.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2001-02-03\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Big 1-3\",\"overview\":\"This is it: Lloyd P. Nebulon is finally 13. He is a man. However, while bragging about it in class, Mrs Bolt assigns him a 50 Megabyte essay on whay it means to be a man for the next day. Lloyd tries poker, but loses his money to a robot toaster. Then he tries fishing but blows up a factory. Then Officer Horten lets him take the wheel of the police car, but Lloyd destroys it and a waste-disposal unit when he goes into hyperdrive.   Because of that, Lloyd is grounded for a month and is made to stay in his room while his mom goes to negotiate with the owners of the factory. However, he has to leave when he finds out Francine is destroying the nursery.   Lloyd eventually gets there and stops Francine before it's too late, using all the tips he had gained. Then, he finally realised what it meant to be a man and finally got to work on the paper.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349673/thumbnail/f2ae1febe0b4484b4fd42bb186bb74b8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-03\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Double Date\",\"overview\":\"The upcoming school dance is here but Lloyd doesn't know who to take until he meets Cindy! But he doesn't know what he's really getting until he meets her other head and finds out she's mean! He then takes his grandpas advice and tries to change the evil head.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349674/thumbnail/cc123c8ebcbb065881e5e98f1d46c843.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-10\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Science Project\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd's science project goes bad when he feeds it too much junk food.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349675/thumbnail/969fb86c3cbe0c2e5a8dcfa3d5b83734.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-17\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Caution: Wormhole!\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd feels unappreciated by his family and friends but after falling into a worm whole on a class field trip and landing in the dumpster 20 ft away he finds out how much he really does mean to everyone!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349676/thumbnail/84f5d62baee1f5629fcaaefe7fcc7953.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Hero of Urbit-Knarr\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd and his pals sneak aboard a visiting hero's spaceship. But they relize he is nothing but a wimp when they take a ride are captured by aliens and Lloyd's mom must rescue them!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349677/thumbnail/4e8bbb4e302b79564dffee12fd2921a7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-03-03\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Daydream Tranceiver\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd is at that age and is going through puberty. In this case all of his secret fantasies are sent out as holograms. This of course causes embarassement for poor Lloyd!\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349678/thumbnail/aab19e8841a359664936b0f264f518ce.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Campout on Zoltan III\",\"overview\":\"After seeing a movie in class about pioneers Lloyd and the gang talk there fathers (and grandpa) to take them camping. They accedntally land on Zoltan III planet of danger. Their parents fight with eachother over doing things which totally ruins the weekend. Soon the gang decide to go on by themselves and get in BIG trouble.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349679/thumbnail/2ca8b724198517375bacbfcf166969b9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-03-31\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Kurtlas, the Symbiotic Boy!\",\"overview\":\"To thrawt off the school bully, Douglas and Kurt work together in a symbiotic realtonship. The result, however, becomes more dangerous than helpful.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349680/thumbnail/b5f38e7b6b4baee53edaccf3cfa77f89.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-07\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Babysitter Lloyd\",\"overview\":\"Mrs. Nebulan is leaving for the weekend and asks Lloyd to take care of Francine for 50 crontards (enough for a sled) Lloyd agrees yet Francine knowing if Lloyd makes a mess he won't get paid decides to blackmail him, He does what she wants and she won't wreck the house. How's Lloyd going to survive?\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349681/thumbnail/18b3f3af1e1b00572be05aef224f832e.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-21\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Android Lloyd\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd sends away for an android replica of himself so he can go and do stuff while he stays home and goofs off. Soon bordem sets in and Lloyd wants to go back to school but android Lloyd won't leave after becoming popular. So now Lloyd must prove he's the real one.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349682/thumbnail/78897a54c38600b36da3caafadd7a692.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-05-19\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Nerd from Beyond the Stars\",\"overview\":\"When a new kid(who looks like a bug)comes he is very tiny and dorky yet Lloyd and the gang take him under there wing and befriend him. But the next week he went through a metamorphisis he becomes big, strong and popular and forgets about Lloyds kindness. So then the gang decides to emarass him as revenge.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episode/349683/thumbnail/80bde577769b5ef8e7adbea7ced38097.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2001-05-26\",\"runtime\":22}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2001-02-03\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}